essly integrate with the dedicated workspace view. The workspace will incorporate a testing view to display input/output comparisons, pass/fail status, and error messages. The execution environment must be client-side and safe, offering visualization tools and highlighting unsupported syntax with a runnable solution.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CVT\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\code-flow-visualizer\\\\app_build\\\\dsa_problems.js\"","EndLine":"60","StartLine":"1","toolAction":"\"Viewing problem record structure in dsa_problems.js\"","toolSummary":"\"View dsa_problems.js structure\""}}]}
